INPUTS
nx = Base grid Size
method = Jibben LVIRA
output = Output Directory 
sample_nx = PU grid 
pu_radius_cells = PU radius as factor of dx 
level_set = shape 

Run example with 
./compiled_examples/level_set_reconstronctuion/level_set_reconstruction [nx] [method] [output] [sample_nx] [pu_radius_cells] [level_set] 


All new weight functions require:

  static inline void evaluate(const Pt& xi, const double& delta,
                              const Pt& x_eval, double* retVal);

  static inline void evaluate(const Pt& xi, const double& delta,
                              const Pt& x_eval,
                              std::pair<double, Eigen::Vector3d>* retVal);

  static inline void evaluate(
      const Pt& xi, const double& delta, const Pt& x_eval,
      std::tuple<double, Eigen::Vector3d, Eigen::Matrix3d>* retVal);